// Invert a chain x > y > z into z > y > x. Every move is checked against the
// simulated tree after the previous ones (§8.2).
== remote
home
  root
    x X
      y Y
        z Z
    w W
== merged
root
  z Z
    y Y
      x X
  w W
== ops
move z to root bottom (from y)
move y to z bottom (from x)
move x to y bottom (from root)
move w to root bottom (from root)
